{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>For he fled</b> Two times in the Masorah: כי ברח יעקב. כי ברח העם. It is found in the Midrash that Amalek told Laban about Jacob's flight, and also Pharaoh about Israel's flight." "<b>כי ברח</b> in gematria: עמלק."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {0 "The two Masorah citations correspond to Genesis 31:22 and 1 Samuel 19:12 respectively; addresses not given by the author."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:27.839126708Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}